Enhanced MCP Server (refactored)

This project is a modular refactor of the code built in the IBM Skills Network
guided lab "Build an Enhanced MCP Server", part of the IBM RAG and Agentic AI
Professional Certificate (Coursera).

Original lab and code authors (IBM):
  - Abdul Fatir, Data Scientist @ IBM
  - Joshua Zhou, Data Scientist @ IBM
  - Joseph Santarcangelo, Data Scientist @ IBM

Original repository: https://github.com/joshuazhou744/enhanced-mcp-server
The lab content is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications in this version: the single-file server.py and client.py were
split into the mcp_server and mcp_client packages, configuration was moved to
environment variables, a test suite was added, and several small fixes were
made (see the "Changes from the original lab" section of README.md).
